      "updated": 1774338739380,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Left side shows ECS with EC2 where you must \nmanage servers (instances, Docker setup, scaling).\nRight side shows Fargate where AWS removes \nservers completely and directly runs containers for you.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Left side shows ECS with EC2 where you must \nmanage servers (instances, Docker setup, scaling).\nRight side shows Fargate where AWS removes \nservers completely and directly runs containers for you.",
